cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts, please cite the Data Descriptor below."
title: "Annotation utilities for the haplotype-resolved genome of seedless wampee (Clausena lansium cv. 'Yunan')"
abstract: >-
  Scripts for systematic gene model renaming, annotation file synchronisation,
  repeat-overlap filtering, lncRNA filtering, EVidenceModeler integration and
  functional/non-coding RNA annotation, as used in the Clausena lansium
  telomere-to-telomere haplotype-resolved genome project.
